 "note": {
  "status": "draft",
  "text": "Common software problems and solutions:\n• The computer is very slow: too many programs open, little free disk space, a virus, many start-up programs → close programs, delete unneeded files, scan for viruses, restart.\n• A program freezes (stops responding) → wait, then close it with the Task Manager (Ctrl+Alt+Del), and restart it.\n• Error messages or crashes → restart, update or reinstall the program.\n• Pop-ups and strange behaviour → malware: run a full antivirus scan.\n• A file will not open → install the right program, check the file is not damaged.\n• Forgotten password → use the recovery option (e-mail or phone).\nPrevention: install software only from trusted sources, keep the system and antivirus updated, do not open unknown attachments, back up regularly.\nRestarting the computer solves many problems.",
  "checks": []
 },
 "worked_example": {
  "status": "draft",
  "vars": {},
  "problem": "A word processor stops responding while you type. What should you do?",
  "steps": [
   "Wait a little: it may recover.",
   "If not, close it with the Task Manager (Ctrl+Alt+Del) and open it again; then save often."
  ],
  "answer": "Wait, then close it with the Task Manager and restart it.",
  "checks": []
 },
